  "worked_solution": "The binomial coefficient $(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{n}{r})$ is given by the formula\n\n$$\n(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{n}{r})=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!\\,r!}.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $n=8$ and $r=3.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{8}{3}) & =\\frac{8!}{(8-3)!\\cdot 3!} \\\\  & =\\frac{8\\cdot 7\\cdot 6\\cdot 5!}{5!\\cdot 3!} \\\\  & =\\frac{8\\cdot 7\\cdot \\cancel{6}\\cdot \\cancel{5!}}{\\cancel{5!}\\cdot \\cancel{6}} \\\\  & =8\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =56.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
